## Key Recommendations

1. Cap discounts at 20% on Furniture and in EMEA
2. Review pricing on the Apple Smart Phone and similar high-sales, low-margin products
3. Discontinue or renegotiate supplier terms for chronic loss-making products
4. Replicate APAC's pricing and discount discipline in EMEA
5. Prioritise Q4 inventory and staffing planning
6. Shift marketing emphasis toward Technology and Home Office

